inal (4:01.38), of the 1972 Olympics. The same year she was awarded the Order of the Red Banner of Labour. She also set three world records in ice hockey.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0172-b91092d330d1:d02\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0172-b91092d330d1:d02:c0\", \"entity\": \"Bragin\", \"scope\": \"sport\", \"claim\": \"Bragin is associated with ice hockey.\", \"answer\": \"ice hockey\", \"quote\": \"Valeri Bragin Valeri Nikolayevich Bragin (); born May 31, 1956, is a retired Russian ice hockey forward.\", \"original_document_number\": 3}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0172-b91092d330d1:d03\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0172-b91092d330d1:d03:c0\", \"entity\": \"Bragin\", \"scope\": \"sport\", \"claim\": \"Bragin is associated with ice hockey.\", \"answer\": \"Ice hockey\", \"quote\": \"members N Not an IIHF member v t e National sports teams of Russia A1 GP American football Badminton Bandy M W Baseball U18 Basketball M M U-20 M U-19 M U-17 W W U-20 W U-19 W U-17 M 3x3 W 3x3 Beach handball M W Beach soccer M W Cricket Field hockey M W Floorball M U-19 W W U-19 Football M M U-21 M U-20 M U-19 M U-17 W W U-20 W U-17 CP Futsal Goalball W W U-19 Gymnastics M W Handball M M U-18 M U-20 W W U-19 W U-17 Ice hockey M\", \"original_document_number\": 4}]}"
